Error [E0764]: `Err` has no parameter labelled `detail`
  --> tests/ui/default_err_unknown_label.jet:2:26
    |
  2 |     return Err("broken", detail: "value")
    |                          ^^^^^^
 Why: The optional labels are `code:` and `cause:`
 Fix: Use `code:` or `cause:`, or remove the argument
